# Astro
/dist/
/.astro/
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Note: the markdown generated from notebooks/ IS committed, on purpose. The
# notebooks seed their RNGs, so re-rendering is byte-stable and a diff means a
# real change in the prose, code or tables. CI regenerates it regardless.

# Python bytecode from scripts/ (notebooks/ has its own rule)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store

# JetBrains IDE
.idea/
*.iml

# Secrets (NASA ADS token)
.env

# Interactive `xy` charts: standalone ~0.5 MB HTML documents, regenerated on
# every build and tightly coupled to the installed xy version. Unlike the
# matplotlib figures these are not byte-stable across upgrades, so they stay out
# of git. `npm run build:all` (not `npm run build`) is what produces them.
/public/charts/
